-- Stage 5 (Years 9-10) two-year core program: 1,120 coming-soon placeholder lessons across six subjects.
-- English and Mathematics: 4 lessons a week, ten four-week units a year (320 each).
-- Science and PDHPE: 2 lessons a week, eight five-week units a year (160 each).
-- History and Geography: 1 lesson a week, eight five-week units a year (80 each).
-- 40 weeks per year. Electives are not included (their placeholders were moved to Stage 4 by 0027).
-- learning_area values match the Lessons page secondary cards: English, Mathematics, Science, History, Geography, PDHPE.
-- Placeholders are shared lessons (family_id NULL) flagged coming_soon. Safe to re-run (INSERT OR IGNORE).
-- Build a lesson by replacing its row's data and removing coming_soon (keep the seed_key or add a topic suffix).
WITH r(sub, area, ln, role) AS (VALUES
  ('eng', 'English', 1, 'Reading and viewing'), ('eng', 'English', 2, 'Writing'), ('eng', 'English', 3, 'Language and vocabulary'), ('eng', 'English', 4, 'Speaking and listening'),
  ('math', 'Mathematics', 1, 'Concept'), ('math', 'Mathematics', 2, 'Strategies'), ('math', 'Mathematics', 3, 'Problem solving'), ('math', 'Mathematics', 4, 'Fluency and review'),
  ('sci', 'Science', 1, 'Investigate'), ('sci', 'Science', 2, 'Apply and analyse'),
  ('hist', 'History', 1, 'Investigate and respond'),
  ('geo', 'Geography', 1, 'Investigate and respond'),
  ('pdh', 'PDHPE', 1, 'Learn and discuss'), ('pdh', 'PDHPE', 2, 'Practise and apply')
),
